<title>UK: Commerzbank Unit sets 400 mln Dkr eight-year bond.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank Unit sets 400 mln Dkr eight-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Kredietbank.  BORROWER   COMMERZBANK OVERSEAS FINANCE NV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  COMMERZBANK AG (RATED AA2/AA-)  AMT    400 MLN DKR   COUPON     *5.00     MATURITY    07.JUL.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.885   PAY DATE    07.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NOTES   FOR FIRST FOUR YEARS THEN STEPS-UP TO 8.0 PCT</p>
<p>THEREAFTER.  </p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 10-20     SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  GOV LAW     GERMAN</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.375     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
